@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT
@uploadId = 1
@attachmentId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1) Solicitar URL firmada para subir ID_FRONT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerType": "CUSTOMER",
  "ownerId": 123,
  "category": "ID_FRONT",
  "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
  "sizeBytes": 524288,
  "originalFileName": "dui_frente.jpg"
}

### 2) Confirmar archivo subido a S3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/files/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{uploadId}},
  "checksumSha256": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"
}

### 3) Listar archivos del cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files?ownerType=CUSTOMER&ownerId=123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Obtener URL firmada de descarga
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/{{attachmentId}}/download-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Revisar documento (approve/reject)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/files/{{attachmentId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve",
  "notes": "Documento legible"
}

### 6) Eliminar adjunto (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/files/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
